To read prices, the tool contacts those suppliers' own websites and internal
endpoints. Automated access to those endpoints is, in general, restricted or
prohibited by the suppliers' terms of service and robots.txt directives (see
README "Data sources & acceptable use"). Running this tool may therefore breach
those terms. You are solely responsible for your own use of it and for complying
