requests from the honest client, respect that by disabling that supplier
(--disable-supplier) rather than attempting to circumvent it.

Prices are best-effort, may be inaccurate or stale, and never constitute a
booking or an offer. ALWAYS verify the price and terms on the supplier's own
website before booking. The software is provided "AS IS", without warranty of
